mapping "W7390.1" source="W7390" target="217748000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W7390 = Swedish national extension of W73 SNOMED CT 217748000, refined with Swedish place=
        and activity= (idrott, sport, motion). Target SNOMED CT 436593 = sctid 217748000, active RF2 INT
        concept (valid 2026-07-01.2099-12-31). Why this target: Athena ICD10 crosswalk maps base W73 (id
        45756319) and the W65-W74 parent (id 40475247) to 436593; the Swedish place/activity refinement
        has no standard SNOMED CT representation (the only activity-specific SNOMED CT drowning concept,
        217754004, is inactive/D), so 436593 is the best standard target and fully subsumes the source.
        Why : clearly correct, Athena-crosswalk-verified for the base code, but a small well-understood
        breadth mismatch (the activity axis is lost) — high tier. Broader because the target fully
        contains every clinical meaning of the source.
        """
}
